WEBVTT

1
00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:01.750
In verse 15.11,

2
00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.291
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.916
that purification of the mind

4
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:07.083
is necessary to see the soul.

5
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:08.250
But if a person

6
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.333
is still caught in material bondages

7
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:13.833
and is not yet able to perceive the soul,

8
00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:14.833
Lord Krishna

9
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:17.583
opens a path for them here.

10
00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:19.125
In verses 15.12

11
00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:22.208
to 15.14, He explains –

12
00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:25.458
even if a person is living only at the level

13
00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:27.083
of body and senses,

14
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:27.875
they can still

15
00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:30.875
develop spiritual vision,

16
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:32.416
if they understand that

17
00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:34.791
the Lord Himself

18
00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:36.916
is the foundation of their entire life-system.

19
00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:37.916
This understanding

20
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:40.458
becomes the first step in opening

21
00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:41.708
the eye of wisdom.

22
00:01:46.916 --> 00:01:47.916
Lord Krishna first

23
00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:51.250
points to three natural sources of light –

24
00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.500
the sun, the moon, and fire –

25
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:55.875
and reveals that

26
00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:59.375
their brilliance too comes from Him.

27
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:01.708
None of this happens on its own.

28
00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:04.833
Behind it all is His arrangement.

29
00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.250
Just as a lamp does not burn

30
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.708
until someone lights it,

31
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:11.250
in the same way the sun itself

32
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.333
shines by His design.

33
00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.875
Without the sun, the day could never arise.

34
00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:20.625
Without fire, food could never be cooked.

35
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:21.791
Without the moon,

36
00:02:21.791 --> 00:02:24.500
plants could receive no nourishment.

37
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.000
Then He brings our attention

38
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.041
from the sky to the earth.

39
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:29.125
He says –

40
00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:31.916
‘I pervade the earth and sustain all beings

41
00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:33.833
with My energy.’

42
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:34.750
The ground

43
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.875
we walk on,

44
00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:38.666
the gravity that holds us,

45
00:02:38.666 --> 00:02:40.416
the plants that grow –

46
00:02:40.416 --> 00:02:44.041
all are possible by His power.

47
00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:47.041
As the essence of the moon, He nourishes

48
00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:50.125
all vegetation with life.

49
00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:50.958
Finally

50
00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:54.333
He brings us inside our own bodies.

51
00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:57.833
He says – ‘I am the fire of digestion

52
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:02.083
within every being.’

53
00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:05.083
We eat the food, but the digestion

54
00:03:05.083 --> 00:03:06.583
is not in our control.

55
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:07.416
This subtle

56
00:03:07.416 --> 00:03:10.958
fire – Vaisvanara – works continuously,

57
00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:13.833
together with the prana and apana,

58
00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:17.791
digesting food and converting it into energy.

59
00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:19.291
In this way, Lord Krishna

60
00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:20.791
gradually brings our consciousness

61
00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:23.375
from the vast cosmos, to the earth,

62
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:26.458
and then into our own body.

63
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:29.833
He shows that whether it is the outer light,

64
00:03:29.833 --> 00:03:33.041
the growth of crops, or the fire within –

65
00:03:33.041 --> 00:03:34.541
all comes from Him.

66
00:03:34.541 --> 00:03:39.041
This understanding is the first step
in opening the eye of wisdom.

67
00:03:43.916 --> 00:03:46.708
Sometimes you feel

68
00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:51.000
that to reach the Lord, you must
leave the world behind,

69
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:58.625
or wait for some great miracle.

70
00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:01.791
Never think this way.

71
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:06.416
Because I am closer to you

72
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:11.333
than you can even imagine.

73
00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:13.625
The light of the sun,

74
00:04:13.625 --> 00:04:15.958
the moon’s nourishment,

75
00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:19.125
and the fire within you that digests your food –

76
00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:22.708
all of this

77
00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:24.750
is My very form.

78
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.625
You do not need to go far

79
00:04:27.625 --> 00:04:30.750
to see Me.

80
00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:35.958
Look around you –

81
00:04:35.958 --> 00:04:38.583
the warmth of sunlight

82
00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:44.000
on your face, the energy that comes from food,

83
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:48.708
and the breath that flows within every moment –

84
00:04:48.708 --> 00:04:52.375
these are all My signs.

85
00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:54.000
In what you

86
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:59.333
consider ordinary and overlook,

87
00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:04.416
wonder and mystery are hidden.

88
00:05:04.416 --> 00:05:08.916
Experience them with a tender heart,

89
00:05:08.916 --> 00:05:13.416
and you will find – life has always

90
00:05:13.416 --> 00:05:17.583
been giving you silent messages.

91
00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:20.458
Spiritual vision does not begin only

92
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:23.958
in temples or scriptures.

93
00:05:23.958 --> 00:05:26.083
It begins when you

94
00:05:26.083 --> 00:05:29.125
open your eyes

95
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:31.083
and learn to see the miracles

96
00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:35.125
unfolding in your very own life.

97
00:05:35.125 --> 00:05:36.416
Reflect on this.

98
00:05:41.041 --> 00:05:43.916
Have you noticed?

99
00:05:43.916 --> 00:05:46.125
Every day in your home

100
00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:49.208
you receive so many blessings –

101
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:55.208
food on the plate, sunlight through the windows,

102
00:05:55.208 --> 00:05:57.000
water to drink,

103
00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:01.125
and moments of joy and laughter
spent together.

104
00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:03.000
But

105
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.583
when all of this starts

106
00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:09.541
to feel ordinary, the feeling of gratitude

107
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:13.583
slowly begins to fade.

108
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.208
Always remember –

109
00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:20.083
the light of the sun, the life of the earth,

110
00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:24.916
and the fire within that digests your food –

111
00:06:24.916 --> 00:06:29.500
all of these are My powers.

112
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.000
When you

113
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.416
recognise the giver

114
00:06:32.416 --> 00:06:36.458
behind the gifts,

115
00:06:36.458 --> 00:06:39.416
everything changes.

116
00:06:39.416 --> 00:06:41.666
Even a simple meal

117
00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:45.125
becomes an occasion for gratitude,

118
00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:48.000
and even an ordinary day

119
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.416
begins to feel like a treasure.

120
00:06:50.416 --> 00:06:52.666
Teach this feeling to your family

121
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:55.500
not only through words,

122
00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.083
but through your conduct.

123
00:06:59.083 --> 00:07:03.666
Pause before eating.

124
00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:06.375
Notice the light

125
00:07:06.375 --> 00:07:09.125
and order spread across this world.

126
00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:11.833
And acknowledge

127
00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:18.250
how much you have already been given.

128
00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.500
When a family

129
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.958
learns to live with gratitude,

130
00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:27.416
small things feel significant,

131
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:30.291
complaints diminish,

132
00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:34.166
and love between each other deepens.

133
00:07:34.166 --> 00:07:36.250
Not every aspect of life

134
00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:40.208
needs to be perfect.

135
00:07:40.208 --> 00:07:44.083
Only your vision needs to be clear –

136
00:07:44.083 --> 00:07:47.041
so you can recognise

137
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:51.958
how much is already flowing

138
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:56.416
into your home from Me.

139
00:07:56.416 --> 00:07:57.875
Blessings.

140
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:04.166
At the workplace,

141
00:08:04.166 --> 00:08:05.208
you often

142
00:08:05.208 --> 00:08:09.000
value only the visible successes –

143
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.291
which deal was closed,

144
00:08:11.291 --> 00:08:14.083
which project was completed,

145
00:08:14.083 --> 00:08:16.333
which target was achieved.

146
00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:20.208
But remember – every result of yours

147
00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:23.083
is possible only with the support of many

148
00:08:23.083 --> 00:08:24.708
invisible forces.

149
00:08:24.708 --> 00:08:28.625
The energy to work, the clarity of thought,

150
00:08:28.625 --> 00:08:32.458
and the easy breath taken
through long meetings –

151
00:08:32.458 --> 00:08:33.500
all of this

152
00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:37.166
is possible moment to moment
by that unseen grace.

153
00:08:37.166 --> 00:08:40.041
In this fast-moving race,

154
00:08:40.041 --> 00:08:43.875
we forget these supports.

155
00:08:43.875 --> 00:08:45.791
But true wisdom

156
00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:49.291
begins when we pause

157
00:08:49.291 --> 00:08:53.166
and recognise this unseen support.

158
00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:56.666
When gratitude settles in the heart,

159
00:08:56.666 --> 00:08:59.500
the mind becomes steady.

160
00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.041
When awareness grows,

161
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:05.041
strength comes to one’s actions.

162
00:09:05.041 --> 00:09:08.416
And when work is done with humility,

163
00:09:08.416 --> 00:09:13.083
leadership deepens even further.

164
00:09:13.083 --> 00:09:17.041
This perspective lightens stress

165
00:09:17.041 --> 00:09:21.833
and transforms success from merely an outer

166
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:24.125
result into an experience of contentment

167
00:09:24.125 --> 00:09:27.750
and deep meaning.
